mediapipe requires python versions lesser than 3.10 (i worked with 3.9.9)

requirements.txt contains all the libraries we need for the entire project  

ffmpeg Must be installed and in PATH of the environment variables ----- must for pydub to work in audiodet.

models/weight/best.pt contains the best trained model for object detection the location of this file will need to be changed in the backend/detection/detection_pipeline

** folder structure should be maintained **

